 (287,352,'A top robot can specialize in the lowest-value placement','The narrator explicitly describes 1323 doing L1 while trusting 2910 and 4272 to complete the other branches, including through the division run. He highlights horizontal stacking and the volume placed in the trough.','This supports an alliance-level objective rather than ranking robot work by coral height. Specialized packing can be the scarce capability after partner branch output is sufficient. Do not require literal branch saturation before beginning L1, and do not turn an opinion about “best robot” into an objective EPA ranking.'),
