 (1436,1501,'Autonomous reliability compounds the finite-resource difference','The source describes Newton completing its intended autonomous in the deciding match and securing algae early, contrasting earlier missed pieces.','A series plan includes execution probability. Extra auto pieces, algae security and L1 packing can create a remaining-work advantage that a close live score obscures. The commentator’s hidden-score psychology is an interpretation; do not claim knowledge of the opposing drive team’s thoughts.')
