 (206,271,'Offseason supply and unfinished auto change the opening','The source describes repeated algae steals and an autonomous routine that does not finish, in an IRI game with additional algae and a different selection format.','Separate altered rules from improved skill. A score or tactic from IRI cannot be placed directly on a Worlds benchmark without a defensible conversion, and a missed routine affects the later risk the trailing alliance takes.'),
