 (173,238,'Guaranteed early supply and tower-RP predictions','At kickoff the narrator proposes depot/outpost autonomous collection and considers autonomous L1 climbing as a route to the tower bonus.','This is an early hypothesis, not evidence that climbing mattered in the eventual season. Preserve it as a prediction that later tower-only match data can test. Guaranteed starting supply also has a cost if contesting neutral fuel would deny more from the opponent.'),
