 (285,350,'Stored fuel buys time to acquire while scoring','The build-season argument connects hopper/indexer throughput with the ability to keep releasing while collecting, using 2017 254 as a mechanism analogy.','The analogy is a functional lineage, not proof that 2017 dimensions or rates transfer. A buffer must bridge the travel gap between fuel patches; its required size depends on real discharge rate and acquisition timing.'),
