 (374,439,'Auto victory and beaching are simultaneous facts','The source describes an alliance winning auto despite opponents reaching neutral fuel first, followed by 6328 beaching on the bump and needing recovery.','Do not use arrival order alone as the auto metric. Scored output, ending inventory and fuel redistribution matter. Mechanical mobility failure also censors later tactical performance; rescue time must be charged to the alliance, not silently removed.'),
